    },
    "• Account details: name, phone number, email, and Sign in with Apple identifier.\n• Household details: your addresses (including precise location, used only to match you to a serving circuit and to give the vet directions), and your pets' details (species, breed, date of birth, and medical notes recorded by a vet).\n• Visit data: booking history, chat messages and photos you send a vet, call metadata (not call recordings) for masked calling, and visit records/prescriptions written by your vet.\n• Payment data: processed by our payment gateway (Razorpay); we never see or store your card, UPI, or bank details ourselves — only the payment status and gateway reference.\n• Device data: push notification token, app version, and coarse usage analytics used to fix crashes and improve reliability." : {
      "comment" : "A list of data that VetCircuit collects from users.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "• Cancelling more than 4 hours before your scheduled slot: full refund.\n• Cancelling within 4 hours of your scheduled slot: 50% refund.\n• Not being available for a confirmed visit (no-show): no refund — the vet held that slot exclusively for you.\n• Refunds are issued to your original payment method, typically within 5-7 business days.\nThis policy is enforced consistently as stated at booking; see Help centre for how to request an exception through support." : {

    },
    "24×7" : {

    },
    "100% goes directly to the vet who visited you." : {

    },
    "A VetCircuit vet or para-vet will visit your home. By continuing, you agree that:\n\n• VetCircuit is a marketplace connecting you with independent, VCI-registered veterinary professionals — not itself a clinic.\n• You'll provide safe, reasonable access to your pet for the visit.\n• Veterinary care carries inherent risk; the vet will explain any procedure before performing it.\n• You can withdraw this consent at any time in Profile → Privacy & consent, which pauses future bookings until it's re-accepted." : {
      "comment" : "The text of the consent/liability waiver.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Accepting moves this visit to the new slot right away. Declining keeps your original time and adds a goodwill credit to your account." : {

    },
    "Active account data is retained while your account exists. Visit, payment, and invoice records are retained as required by Indian tax and consumer-protection law even after account deletion. Chat messages tied to a visit are retained for the same window as the visit record, to support any dispute raised about that visit." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing data retention.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
