    },
    "As a data principal under India's Digital Personal Data Protection framework, you can: view and withdraw specific consents (Profile → Privacy & consent), export a copy of your data, and request deletion of your account. Deletion has a 30-day window to undo it by mistake, after which your personal data is purged — financial records required to be retained by law (e.g. invoices) are kept for the legally mandated period, clearly separate from your personal profile." : {

